  "reason": "The top-performing family is clearly scvi_n200 + multiprofile + transformer, with config_010 (vit_l, weighted) at 0.7250 and config_050 (vit_l, concat) at 0.7207. Config_020 (resnet50, weighted) scored 0.7131 accuracy but notably the highest F1 (0.6945), suggesting resnet50 captures complementary class-discriminative features. Config_007 (scvi_n200, resnet50, transformer, concat) is the only untested corner of the image_encoder × fusion 2×2 grid within this proven high-performing family. With only 2 experiments remaining, staying within the validated architecture is essential; this experiment tests whether the concat fusion (which slightly underperformed weighted with vit_l) might interact favorably with resnet50's feature space, potentially yielding a configuration that exceeds 0.7250. It is the highest-information, lowest-risk next step given the strong evidence for this architectural core."
